      "lines": [
        "事实上，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$x_{k+1}=(k+1)^3+5(k+1)=k^3+3k^2+3k+1+5k+5↵=(k^3+5k)+3k(k+1)+6=x_k+3k(k+1)+6$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们看到，$x_{k+1}$是由三项组成的. 由于$A(k)$成立，这个",
        "和的第一项$x_k$可以被$6$整除；因为乘积$k(k+1)$是偶数，第二",
        "项也可以被$6$整除（说明为什么？）. 因此，组成$x_{k+1}$的三项",
        "都可以被$6$整除. 这意味着$x_{k+1}$也可以被$6$整除. 命题证",
        "明完毕."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例3. 求证：当$h>-1$时，不等式"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$(1+h)^n\\geqslant1+nh$　　　　　　　（3）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "对于任意正整数$n$都成立*."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1. 当$n=1$时，有$1+h=1+h$，即关系“$>$”或“$=$”成立.",
        "这就是说，命题$A(1)$成立."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "2. 现在证明：$A(k)\\Longrightarrow A(k+1)$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "不等式$(1+h)^k\\geqslant1+kh$的两边乘以$1+h$，由条件",
        "$h>-1$，得$1+h>0$，因此不等号方向不变. 于是，有"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$(1+h)^{k+1}\\geqslant(1+kh)(1+h)=1+kh+h+kh^2$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因为最后一项$kh^2\\geqslant0$，所以可以略去，得"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$(1+h)^{k+1}\\geqslant1+(k+1)h$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "数学归纳法证明的两部分已完成. 因此伯努利不等式成",
        "立."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "现在我们熟悉了论证一般结论的三种方法，其中前两种",
        "方法，在数学范围之外，也有广泛的应用."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": "note",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "* 不等式（3）叫做伯努利不等式，是为了纪念著名的瑞士数学家伯努利",
        "（1654—1705）而命名的."
      ]
    },
